  "title": { "en": "Numbers and age", "uz": "Sonlar va yosh", "ru": "Числа и возраст", "tr": "Sayılar ve yaş" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Count to twenty, say your age and ask questions with \"how many\".",
    "uz": "Yigirmagacha sanang, yoshingizni ayting va \"how many\" bilan savol bering.",
    "ru": "Посчитайте до двадцати, назовите свой возраст и задайте вопрос с \"how many\".",
    "tr": "Yirmiye kadar say, yaşını söyle ve \"how many\" ile soru sor."
  },
  "guide": "pix",
  "color": "#3B82F6",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "One book, two books", "uz": "One book, two books", "ru": "One book, two books", "tr": "One book, two books" },
    "body": {
      "en": "After any number bigger than one, add -s to the noun: one book, two books, ten years. Uzbek and Turkish keep the noun singular after a number, but English does not. After \"How many\" the noun also takes -s: How many brothers do you have? For age, say \"am / is / are\" + number + \"years old\": I am twenty years old.",
      "uz": "Birdan katta sondan keyin otga -s qo'shiladi: one book, two books, ten years. O'zbek tilida \"ikkita kitob\" deymiz, ingliz tilida esa \"two books\". \"How many\" dan keyin ham ot -s oladi: How many brothers do you have? Yosh \"am / is / are\" + son + \"years old\" bilan aytiladi: I am twenty years old.",
      "ru": "После числа больше одного к существительному добавляется -s: one book, two books, ten years. После \"How many\" тоже нужно -s: How many brothers do you have? Возраст называют так: \"am / is / are\" + число + \"years old\". По-русски «мне двадцать лет», а по-английски I am twenty years old.",
      "tr": "Birden büyük bir sayıdan sonra isme -s eklenir: one book, two books, ten years. Türkçede \"iki kitap\" deriz, İngilizcede ise \"two books\". \"How many\" sorusundan sonra da isim -s alır: How many brothers do you have? Yaş \"am / is / are\" + sayı + \"years old\" ile söylenir: I am twenty years old."
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "I have two brothers.", "native": { "uz": "Mening ikkita akam bor.", "ru": "У меня два брата.", "tr": "İki erkek kardeşim var." } },
      { "en": "How many books do you have?", "native": { "uz": "Senda nechta kitob bor?", "ru": "Сколько у тебя книг?", "tr": "Kaç kitabın var?" } },
      { "en": "I am twenty years old.", "native": { "uz": "Men yigirma yoshdaman.", "ru": "Мне двадцать лет.", "tr": "Ben yirmi yaşındayım." } }
    ]
  },
